### -----------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY ENDPOINTS (Week 04 / Phase 2)
### -----------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Check current authentication status (logged out: loggedIn = false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/status HTTP/1.1

### 2. Register a new user account (Password hashed with bcrypt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "filmfanatic",
  "email": "filmfanatic@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 3. Log in with local credentials (starts session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "filmfanatic@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 4. Check authentication status after logging in (loggedIn = true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/status HTTP/1.1

### 5. View Protected User Profile (Requires authentication)
### Succeeds with 200 when logged in, returns 401 when logged out
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile HTTP/1.1

### 6. View My Personal Reviews (Protected view only available when logged in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/user/my-reviews HTTP/1.1

### 7. Log out current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1

### 8. Attempt accessing Protected Profile after logout (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile HTTP/1.1

